Input: {"question": "Which person or organization did Kiwon Song work for?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 10, "text": "Kiwon Song"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 12, "end": 129, "text": "Kiwon Song is a renowned South Korean biochemist who has made significant contributions to the field of biochemistry."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 130, "end": 283, "text": "One of the notable aspects of his career is his association with the Technical University of Denmark, where he worked as a researcher and faculty member."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 284, "end": 308, "text": "Early Life and Education"}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 310, "end": 374, "text": "Kiwon Song was born on February 12, 1975, in Seoul, South Korea."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 375, "end": 468, "text": "He completed his undergraduate degree in biochemistry from Seoul National University in 1997."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 469, "end": 574, "text": "He then pursued his graduate studies at the University of California, Berkeley, where he earned his Ph.D."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 575, "end": 599, "text": "in biochemistry in 2003."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 600, "end": 606, "text": "Career"}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 608, "end": 726, "text": "After completing his Ph.D., Song worked as a postdoctoral researcher at the University of Cambridge from 2003 to 2005."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 727, "end": 875, "text": "During this period, he published several papers on protein structure and function, which garnered significant attention in the scientific community."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 876, "end": 919, "text": "Technical University of Denmark (2005-2010)"}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 921, "end": 1066, "text": "In 2005, Song joined the Technical University of Denmark (DTU) as an assistant professor in the Department of Biochemistry and Molecular Biology."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1067, "end": 1172, "text": "During his tenure at DTU, he established himself as a leading expert in the field of protein engineering."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1173, "end": 1333, "text": "He published several papers in top-tier journals, including the Journal of Biological Chemistry and Biochemistry, and received numerous awards for his research."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1334, "end": 1498, "text": "One of his most notable contributions during this period was the development of a novel protein expression system, which was patented in 2008 (US Patent 7,429,453)."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1499, "end": 1645, "text": "This system, known as the \"Song Expression System,\" has been widely used in the biotechnology industry for the production of recombinant proteins."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1646, "end": 1668, "text": "Studies and References"}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1670, "end": 1776, "text": "Several studies have highlighted Song's contributions to the field of biochemistry during his time at DTU."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1777, "end": 1940, "text": "A 2009 study published in the journal Nature Methods cited Song's work on protein engineering as a key factor in the development of novel therapeutic proteins (1)."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1941, "end": 2106, "text": "Another study published in 2010 in the journal Biochemical and Biophysical Research Communications recognized Song's expertise in protein structure and function (2)."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2107, "end": 2118, "text": "References:"}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2120, "end": 2131, "text": "(1) Lee, J."}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2132, "end": 2138, "text": "et al."}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2139, "end": 2146, "text": "(2009)."}, "D1S26": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2147, "end": 2217, "text": "\"Development of novel therapeutic proteins using protein engineering.\""}, "D1S27": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2218, "end": 2249, "text": "Nature Methods, 6(10), 731-736."}, "D1S28": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2250, "end": 2261, "text": "(2) Kim, H."}, "D1S29": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2262, "end": 2268, "text": "et al."}, "D1S30": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2269, "end": 2276, "text": "(2010)."}, "D1S31": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2277, "end": 2340, "text": "\"Structural and functional analysis of a novel protein family.\""}, "D1S32": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2341, "end": 2410, "text": "Biochemical and Biophysical Research Communications, 402(2), 241-246."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 86, "text": "**Breaking News: Renowned Biochemist Kiwon Song's Ties to Yonsei University Revealed**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 88, "end": 325, "text": "Seoul, South Korea - In a breakthrough discovery, our investigative team has uncovered conclusive evidence linking esteemed biochemist Kiwon Song to Yonsei University, a prestigious private institution with campuses in Seoul and Incheon."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 326, "end": 555, "text": "According to multiple sources, including academic records and research publications, Kiwon Song held a position at Yonsei University, further solidifying the institution's reputation as a hub for cutting-edge scientific research."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 556, "end": 559, "text": "Dr."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 560, "end": 714, "text": "Joon Kim, a colleague of Song's at Yonsei University, corroborated the findings, stating, \"Kiwon Song was an integral part of our biochemistry department."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 715, "end": 850, "text": "His groundbreaking research on protein structures and functions was instrumental in advancing our understanding of biological systems.\""}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 851, "end": 1082, "text": "A review of Song's publication history reveals a plethora of research papers co-authored with Yonsei University faculty members, including a seminal study on enzyme kinetics published in the Journal of Biological Chemistry in 2015."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1083, "end": 1303, "text": "Data from the university's website and academic databases confirms Song's affiliation with Yonsei University, with records showing his involvement in various research projects and academic programs between 2010 and 2018."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1304, "end": 1510, "text": "\"Kiwon Song's contributions to the field of biochemistry are undeniable, and his association with Yonsei University is a testament to the institution's commitment to fostering innovative research,\" said Dr."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1511, "end": 1601, "text": "Sung-Hoon Kim, Dean of the College of Life Science and Biotechnology at Yonsei University."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1602, "end": 1825, "text": "Our investigation has also uncovered evidence of Song's participation in international conferences and workshops hosted by Yonsei University, including the 2017 International Symposium on Biochemistry and Molecular Biology."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1826, "end": 2009, "text": "In light of these findings, it is clear that Kiwon Song did, in fact, work for Yonsei University, further cementing the institution's reputation as a bastion of scientific excellence."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "University of Cambridge", "card_ids": ["d1:c1"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c1", "entity": "Kiwon Song", "scope": "Employment", "claim": "Kiwon Song worked as a postdoctoral researcher at the University of Cambridge from 2003 to 2005.", "answer": "University of Cambridge", "quote": "After completing his Ph.D., Song worked as a postdoctoral researcher at the University of Cambridge from 2003 to 2005.", "original_document_number": 1}], "initial_answers": ["Technical University of Denmark", "Yonsei University", "University of Cambridge"]}
